{
  "id": 21,
  "name": "progress_aware_regret_with_cluster_hint",
  "intent": "Tighten the regret schedule (floor 0.05->0.10, ceiling 0.30->0.35) so uniform-density tours get stronger second-lookahead differentiation throughout, trim the return ceiling (0.45->0.40) to preserve a bounded total auxiliary weight, and add a decaying cluster_density hint (0.08*(1-progress)) that reinforces tight cluster traversal in the early-to-mid phase when local geometry dominates, then fades so late-tour selection stays regret-driven. Hypothesis: stronger uniform regret resolution plus an early-progress cluster cue jointly address the parent's uniform weakness while protecting the grid/cluster gains already achieved.",
  "tags": [
    "regret",
    "cluster"
  ],
  "code": "def priority(f):\n    dist = f['distance']\n    ret = f['return_distance']\n    prog = max(0.0, min(1.0, f['progress']))\n    regret = f['regret']\n    cluster = f['cluster_density']\n    return_coeff = 0.20 + 0.20 * prog\n    regret_coeff = 0.10 + 0.25 * prog\n    cluster_coeff = 0.08 * (1.0 - prog)\n    return -dist + return_coeff * ret + regret_coeff * regret + cluster_coeff * cluster",
